Third-party attributions
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Bolt's core has no third-party dependencies. The attributions below cover
external work that Bolt studied or drew technique from. No third-party source
is vendored into this repository.

llama.cpp / ggml (MIT License)
Copyright (c) 2023-2024 The ggml authors
https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp

  The Vulkan matmul+dequant compute shaders in `shaders/` were written from
  scratch for Bolt's own quantization layout (low-nibble-first Int4, separate
  per-row scale array) after studying the design of ggml-vulkan's
  `mul_mat_vec.comp` for transferable technique. No ggml source is copied or
  included. See each `.comp` file's header comment for Bolt's byte-packing
  details.

libuv (MIT License)
Copyright (c) 2015-present libuv project contributors
https://github.com/libuv/libuv

  `src/api/net/event_loop_iocp.cpp` follows IOCP usage patterns documented in
  libuv's `src/win/winsock.c` and `src/win/tcp.c`. The implementation is
  Bolt's own; libuv is referenced for its treatment of the Windows IOCP API.

QuestDB (Apache License 2.0)
Copyright QuestDB Limited
https://github.com/questdb/questdb

  `docs/research/questdb-symbol-code-audit.md` cites QuestDB source file paths
